                  --Des_D   "Execute the command ${GAoh}dnf5 distro-sync${DEF}. This tries to make your installed packages exactly the same version as in currently enabled repositories, even if it means downgrading some packages. This may help solve the problem:\n\t\t\t	Error: package XXXX requires YYYY, but none of the providers can be installed." \
